  "disclaimer": "Important Notice: The Dog & Cat Teeth Cleaning Boutique is not a veterinary practice, and our services do not replace veterinary care. We do not diagnose, treat, or provide medical care for any health condition, and we do not prescribe or recommend prescription medications. We always recommend that pet owners maintain regular veterinary visits and seek veterinary care whenever they have concerns about their pet’s health.",
